  "content": "\n\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 100+ 任务</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 完全重做的世界生成（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes o' Plenty</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 全面优化</strong>&nbsp;</h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 自定义 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.horizon.pics%252f39d7ccdc-f694-466a-832b-027a84051a8f%253fa%253d580%2526mime1%253dimage%2526mime2%253dpng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">着色器预设</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 包含 1.20.2+ 版本的内容（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillabackport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Backport</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 重做的要塞与堡垒</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 全新首领与生物（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mowzies-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mowzie's Mobs</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cataclysm</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 数千个全新地牢与建筑（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorabuild-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdoraBuild: Structures</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a> 维度经过大量调整与新增内容（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Redux</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Villages</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 提升体验的生活质量（QoL）功能，例如&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones</a>&nbsp;与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-tome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">XP Tomes</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 带有额外功能的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">可骑乘的龙</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 众多自定义功能以优化游戏体验</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 内置,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tLTC6wYcWVM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">免费分享世界</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f64026%252fbetter-mc-forge-bmc4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">350+ 模组</a></strong></h5>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/z-IddtxivNA\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SV_SKlxNEUM\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>并非官方 Minecraft 产品。未获得 Mojang 或微软的批准，也不与其存在任何关联。</strong></span></h5>",
